  "notes": "{組|く}む is a versatile verb whose core meaning involves interlocking or joining things together. It extends to forming groups and creating structures.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive)\n- Pair: {組|く}まれる (passive)\n\nASPECT (ている):\n{組|く}んで⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧ describes a resulting state: ⟦{腕|うで}→腕：01006_ude⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{組|く}んで⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧ (has arms folded).\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦チーム→チーム：03858_chiimu⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{組|く}む: to form a team\n- ⟦{腕|うで}→腕：01006_ude⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{組|く}む: to fold/cross one's arms\n- ⟦{脚|あし}→足：00575_ashi⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{組|く}む: to cross one's legs\n- ⟦{予定|よてい}→予定：00824_yotei⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{組|く}む: to put together a schedule\n- ⟦{番組|ばんぐみ}→番組：01705_bangumi⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{組|く}む: to arrange a program\n\nCOMPOUNDS:\n- ⟦{組|く}み{合|あ}わせる→組み合わせる：04659_kumiawaseru⟧: to combine\n- ⟦{組|く}み{立|た}てる→組み立てる：04661_kumitateru⟧: to assemble (a product)\n- ⟦{番組|ばんぐみ}→番組：01705_bangumi⟧: TV/radio program",
